      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The resolution to this:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Added handling of the link rel=type header to explicitly set interaction model</li>\n\t<li>Removed handling of Content-Disposition in requests.  This was the former mechanism for forcing an LDP-NR model</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "15/Sep/17 12:47 PM",
