  "description": "<p>CRUD capabilities need to be updated, such that in a successful resource creation request, if a Link: rel=\"type\" request header specifies the LDP-NR interaction model (<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a>, regardless of Content-Type: value), then the server should handle subsequent requests to the newly created resource as if it is an LDP-NR.</p>",
